  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience in the Sahel through Adaptive Social Protection Fund - Social Protection component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Bank&apos;s Sahel Adaptive Social Protection Programme contributes to the overall objectives of the Shock Response Programme.  The FCDO provides funding to a multi-donor trust fund in conjunction with the governments of France, Germany and Denmark.  The World Bank work with the governments of the Sahel countries to provide this support to those vulnerable from climate and other forms of shock.</narrative>
  </description>
